      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T10:16:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we try unrolling this by two output rows?\n\nThe compiler currently emits register moves for the sliding window update. Computing two outputs per iteration should reduce that window-shuffle overhead per output.",
